      IBM handle names no Atlas entry declared here: 32
      MIT id and label disagree: 1
      NIST handle bundles several categories: 2
      OECD is absorbed, not represented: 16
      broadMatch or narrowMatch written opposite to SKOS: 30
      exactMatch would make two catalogues' entries identical: 2

    skos:narrower is omitted as the inverse of the skos:broader kept here.
