eticas:fitness-for-purpose a nexus:Risk ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fitness for purpose and task effectiveness"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "Fitness for purpose"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "Task success"@en ;
    skos:definition "The system has not been validated against the problem it is intended to solve, or is deployed for a task or context beyond the one it was validated for. Covers the ex ante question (was this designed and validated for this problem?) and its enforcement in deployment; whether the system actually succeeds at the task in operation is task-performance (Reliability)."@en ;
    skos:broader eticas:governance-compliance ;
    nexus:isPartOf eticas:governance-compliance ;
